#)Under Graduation (12th Pass) / Graduation & Any Master degree

 We have urgent requirement for Sales Executive / Sr Sales Executive and Sales Manager in below mentioned location. . Hyderabad (Telangana) 

) Must have Two wheeler with driving license

) Candidates with minimum 6 months experience in Auto loan Industry. . #) Fresher Can also apply

Key Skills: Sales,Field Sales,Tractor Loan,Tractor Finance,Retail Sales,B2C Sales,Construction Equipment,Farm Equipment

**Description** 




 We are seeking an experienced Salesforce Marketing Cloud (SFMC) Developer to support regional marketing campaigns, customer engagement initiatives, and SFMC platform operations across multiple APAC markets, with a primary focus on Vietnam.




**Mandatory Skill(s)** 



* 3–5\+ years of hands\-on experience with Salesforce Marketing Cloud (SFMC);
* Proven experience in developing and executing marketing campaigns using SFMC;
* Strong hands\-on expertise in Journey Builder, Automation Studio, Data Extensions, Content Builder, and Email Studio;
* Good working knowledge of SQL for audience segmentation and campaign data management;
* Experience supporting email marketing, customer engagement, cross\-sell, and marketing automation campaigns;
* Strong troubleshooting and production support skills, with the ability to resolve campaign and platform issues efficiently;
* Comfortable working with regional and cross\-functional teams across multiple markets;
* Able to manage multiple priorities independently in a fast\-paced environment while ensuring timely campaign delivery.



**Desirable Skill(s)** 



* Ability to work independently and manage multiple campaigns effectively;
* Experience in the financial services or insurance industry is an added advantage.



**Responsibilities** 



* Develop, configure, test, and deploy marketing campaigns using Salesforce Marketing Cloud (SFMC);
* Support campaign execution, relaunches, cross\-sell campaigns, and customer engagement initiatives;
* Configure and manage Data Extensions, Automation Studio, Journey Builder, Content Builder, and Email Studio;
* Develop and optimise SQL queries for audience segmentation and campaign data preparation;
* Perform campaign testing, troubleshooting, and quality checks before deployment;
* Provide BAU and ad hoc technical support to regional Business Units;
* Support Group Office\-led campaigns and SFMC platform activities;
* Assist with SFMC technical and security enhancements, including client secret rotation and related platform updates;
* Collaborate with marketing, technology, Group Office, and local market teams across the region;
* Complete knowledge transfer and document key campaign processes and technical configurations.









 Should you be interested in this career opportunity, please send in your updated resume to apply@sciente.com at the earliest.










 When you apply, you voluntarily consent to the disclosure, collection and use of your personal data for employment/recruitment and related purposes in accordance with the SCIENTE Group Privacy Policy, a copy of which is published at SCIENTE’s website (https://www.sciente.com/privacy\-policy).










 Confidentiality is assured, and only shortlisted candidates will be notified for interviews.




